{"n": 819, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "819.webp", "text": "41-304\n\n4132515 REPLACING LEFT OR RIGHT\nCOWL PANEL\n— ROOF PANEL REMOVED —\n\nRemove scrap metal\n\nStraighten and grind mating surfaces\n\nCoat mating surfaces intended for spot welding\nwith zinc dust paint\n\nRefer to information on page 41 - 001.\nRemove or disconnect following parts:\ninstrument panel trim, grill on bottom of cowl,\nfront door, front bumper, front side panel.\n\nDrill off welded spots on window opening. Straighten and grind mating surfaces\n\nCut off panet on outside.\n\n—\n\n30 41196\n\nDrill off welded spots on roof frame joint, Grind mating surfaces Sn new cowl-\nCoat mating surfaces intended for spot welding\nwith zinc dust paint.\n\n3041201\n\nClear joint surface.\nRemove brazing solder.\nTake off cowl panel.\n\nInstall and clamp cowl panel, tack welding lightly\nin window opening.\n\n30 41198 30 41202", "words": [["41-304", 0.463, 0.0285, 0.5456, 0.0517], ["4132515", 0.2614, 0.0597, 0.31, 0.0703], ["REPLACING", 0.3232, 0.059, 0.386, 0.0703], ["LEFT", 0.3906, 0.059, 0.4174, 0.0696], ["OR", 0.4215, 0.059, 0.4362, 0.0703], ["RIGHT", 0.4407, 0.059, 0.4752, 0.0703], ["COWL", 0.3232, 0.0749, 0.3536, 0.0862], ["PANEL", 0.3576, 0.0749, 0.3931, 0.0862], ["—", 0.3242, 0.0968, 0.3303, 0.0988], ["ROOF", 0.3343, 0.0908, 0.3642, 0.1021], ["PANEL", 0.3683, 0.0908, 0.4037, 0.1015], ["REMOVED", 0.4083, 0.0908, 0.463, 0.1021], ["—", 0.4681, 0.0968, 0.4742, 0.0988], ["Remove", 0.7523, 0.059, 0.7923, 0.0696], ["scrap", 0.7958, 0.0617, 0.8202, 0.071], ["metal", 0.8237, 0.059, 0.8495, 0.069], ["Straighten", 0.7523, 0.0743, 0.8024, 0.0875], ["and", 0.8055, 0.0749, 0.8232, 0.0849], ["grind", 0.8267, 0.0749, 0.8511, 0.0875], ["mating", 0.8551, 0.0763, 0.887, 0.0869], ["surfaces", 0.8906, 0.0743, 0.9281, 0.0849], ["Coat", 0.7523, 0.0902, 0.7746, 0.1008], ["mating", 0.7791, 0.0928, 0.8116, 0.1034], ["surfaces", 0.8151, 0.0902, 0.8531, 0.1008], ["intended", 0.8571, 0.0908, 0.8982, 0.1008], ["for", 0.9027